AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0009465> "This term represents both \"hereditary\" and \"non-hereditary\" multiple intestinal atresia. It is generally accepted to not distinguish the non-hereditary concept, and use the term \"multiple intestinal atresia\" to refer to non-hereditary multiple intestinal atresia (PMID:33674188). Since this distinction is not necessary, we have not created a specific term for \"non-hereditary multiple intestinal atresia\". However, if the need arises, a new term can be added to Mondo to represent this concept. This term's classification was reviewed in the context of the Strategic Refinement project (2023) and was determined to be excluded from the 'immune system disorder' (MONDO:0005046) ontology branch (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8216-5084).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0009465> "multiple intestinal atresia")
