AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:98818") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://rarediseases.info.nih.gov/diseases/6855/landau-kleffner-syndrome") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0009509> "A rare form of epileptic encephalopathy with spike-wave activation in sleep (EE-SWAS) characterized by various combinations of acquired cognitive, language, behavioral, and motor deficits associated with marked spike- and- wave activation in sleep. In Landau-Kleffner syndrome, receptive language is mainly affected, with an acquired auditory verbal agnosia.")
